1
00:00:09,119 --> 00:00:09,919
Yu Song.

2
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:11,320
Run!

3
00:00:11,839 --> 00:00:12,640
Run!

4
00:00:14,359 --> 00:00:15,519
Don't hurt Yu Song.

5
00:00:21,239 --> 00:00:22,719
=Dear Song=
(Sorry, Dad.)

6
00:00:22,719 --> 00:00:24,000
=Dear Song=
(I don't think I can)

7
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,120
(leave Song Cheng behind.)

8
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,710
=Episode 17=
(A Quiet Battle)

9
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,359
Cheng.

10
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,520
How are you settling in at the company?

11
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,479
Yu Song

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,600
has interned at several top firms

13
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,799
in the industry.

14
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,679
With her help,

15
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:43,200
I've mostly learned the group's

16
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,520
structure and operations.

17
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,079
Yu Song.

18
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,079
Having you at the company with Cheng

19
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,200
puts me at ease.

20
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,520
Thank you, Mr. Song.

21
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,000
Running a company

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,000
is like fishing.

23
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:57,840
It looks calm on the surface,

24
00:00:58,119 --> 00:01:00,719
but there's a battle raging below.

25
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,200
You need to know your role.

26
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,640
Are you setting the bait

27
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,640
or are you the bait?

28
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,519
You need confidence,

29
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,920
but patience matters even more.

30
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:12,439
If you rush things,

31
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,920
you could become the bait.

32
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,840
It's fine.

33
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:39,319
Cheng.

34
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,120
You're not like Song Huan.

35
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:42,120
You're sensible.

36
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,560
Tonight,

37
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,400
I'll make you fish soup.

38
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:01,000
A client said they left some papers
at the club.

39
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,959
I'll go get them.

40
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,439
Mm.

41
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,719
Be careful.

42
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,560
So you're Yu Song.

43
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,199
I heard

44
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:51,439
you haven't been very obedient lately.

45
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,960
Someone asked me to give you

46
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,159
some special treatment.

47
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:58,439
Song Huan sent you, didn't she?

48
00:02:58,759 --> 00:03:00,159
Ms. Song Huan's right.

49
00:03:00,159 --> 00:03:02,000
You really are smart.

50
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,199
But...

51
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,800
Even a clever woman

52
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,560
can't escape my grasp.

53
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,879
Darn!

54
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:36,919
Something's wrong...

55
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,199
Go on, run.

56
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,719
Go ahead.

57
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:43,840
What, not running anymore?

58
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,599
Just watch what I do

59
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,039
to you today.

60
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,159
Song!

61
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:52,879
Who are you?

62
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:02,639
Stop! Stop hitting me!

63
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,319
Please, stop!

64
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:04,560
Stop!

65
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,000
Song.

66
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:05,960
Are you okay?

67
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,319
- Let's go.
- That guy hits too hard.

68
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,879
Ms. Song Huan.

69
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:20,680
This job costs extra!

70
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,120
Are you sure you don't need to go
to the hospital?

71
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,800
No need.

72
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,800
I'm fine now.

73
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,920
Good thing you put pepper spray
in my bag.

74
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,680
Otherwise,

75
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,319
I might not have lasted until you came.

76
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,519
Pepper spray?

77
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,800
Didn't you put it there?

78
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,519
No, I didn't.

79
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,399
♪The crescent moon♪

80
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,000
♪The birds all sing♪

81
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:50,360
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

82
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:53,399
A client said they left some papers
at the club.

83
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,360
I'll go get them.

84
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:57,439
Be careful.

85
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,000
♪The fish are plump♪

86
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,399
♪The fish are lovely♪

87
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:11,920
♪Just pray Papa comes home safe♪

88
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,956
(Song)

89
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,519
Like I told you before,

90
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,160
I'll always protect you.

91
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,800
I was careless.

92
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,399
Song Huan's so proud,

93
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,519
yet she resorted to such dirty tricks.

94
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,720
She must be pretty mad.

95
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,800
From now on,

96
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,399
you need to be more careful.

97
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,800
Song Huan...

98
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,720
Try that again,

99
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,120
and it won't be wine next time.

100
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,160
Song Huan.

101
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,720
You're not the only one
who can play dirty.

102
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,959
I clawed out of the mud.

103
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,600
When it comes to dirty tricks,

104
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:23,040
I know just as many as you do.

105
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,600
I've never seen you so rash.

106
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,399
If you can help that fool Song Cheng
plot against me,

107
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,160
why can't I hit back?

108
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,720
That's just the appetizer.

109
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,879
You think

110
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:43,199
joining the company
will turn things around for you?

111
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,160
You're a wolf walking
into a tiger's den.

112
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:47,120
You'll be eaten, bones and all.

113
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,360
Fine.

114
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,839
Then let's find out.

115
00:06:58,993 --> 00:07:00,174
(Song Group)
(This hot spring project)

116
00:07:00,174 --> 00:07:02,409
(will be benchmarked against many hotels
across the country)

117
00:07:02,409 --> 00:07:03,560
(for research and reference.)

118
00:07:03,762 --> 00:07:05,743
(The project covers about)

119
00:07:05,841 --> 00:07:06,952
(30,000 square meters.)

120
00:07:06,952 --> 00:07:10,440
(The outdoor eco-zone
covers 6,000 square meters.)

121
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,895
(The scale is set.)

122
00:07:11,895 --> 00:07:12,995
(Next, the focus is)

123
00:07:13,031 --> 00:07:15,025
(Meeting Room)
(on building our own...)

124
00:07:15,728 --> 00:07:17,115
(Hot Spring Hotel Project Progress)

125
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,240
Ms. Yu Song.

126
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,720
The Audit Department received a report.

127
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,639
You're accused of abusing your position

128
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,759
to take bribes.

129
00:07:23,759 --> 00:07:25,319
Please cooperate with our investigation
immediately.

130
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,399
Impossible.

131
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,199
Yu Song would never do that.

132
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,600
Do you have proof?

133
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,839
This is the material
the informant provided.

134
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,399
Also,

135
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:35,319
we found a suspicious
500,000 yuan transfer.

136
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:38,120
It came from the main supplier
for the hot spring project.

137
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:38,800
Ms. Song Cheng.

138
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:41,120
I understand you want to
protect your staff.

139
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:41,680
But...

140
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:44,240
Mr. Song just made you project manager.

141
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:46,120
I hope you don't do anything foolish.

142
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,000
You...

143
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,319
Don't do anything rash.

144
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,120
It's Song Huan.

145
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,180
(30,000 sq m total; 6,000 sq m eco-zone)

146
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:05,199
The report mentions alleged kickbacks.

147
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:07,639
Which contract clause are they tied to?

148
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,120
I can pull up the digital contract
right here

149
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,120
and compare it.

150
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,199
Go ahead.

151
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,959
(Nice move, Song Huan.)

152
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,519
(The contract was altered.)

153
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,200
The digital contract was tampered with.

154
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:35,559
I can provide the verification code
from when it was archived,

155
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,720
and the archived copy.

156
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,519
Okay.

157
00:08:37,639 --> 00:08:39,600
Then please come with us
and cooperate with the investigation.

158
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,000
I'm calling Dad right now.

159
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:47,600
Let's go.

160
00:08:57,911 --> 00:08:59,631
(Song Group)

161
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:03,320
You two kids...

162
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:04,759
Well?

163
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,919
Business isn't much fun, is it?

164
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:14,840
You can't even make sense of
the contracts out in the open.

165
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,519
As for the moves behind the scenes,

166
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,720
you're even more out of your depth.
